Package: miadi-film
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: kdenlive, ardour, ffmpeg, mediainfo, libimage-exiftool-perl, sox, v4l-utils
Recommends: miadi-music, obs-studio, frei0r-plugins, mkvtoolnix
Suggests: miadi, audacity
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Film on a Miadi host: edit, design the sound, inspect the media
 Installs the tools a Miadi host needs to make a film with a Chronicle
 episode (Episode 120, relational film production):
  kdenlive   editing; a .kdenlive project is MLT XML, so an agent can read
             it and add markers while the editor makes every cut
  ardour     sound design and mix; a session is XML and runs Lua scripts
  ffmpeg, mediainfo, exiftool, sox   probe, convert and tag media
  v4l-utils  cameras on Video4Linux
 Recommends miadi-music (the score), obs-studio (screen and camera
 recording), frei0r-plugins (Kdenlive effects) and mkvtoolnix.
 `miadi-film check` reports each tool, its version and its package.
